<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 43.98 to 5992.48.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 2.13 to 373.78.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.23.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1203 to 1112.</p>
<p>Volume was 415,019,010, compared with 439,636,340 Wednesday.</p>
